{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/508619b36677d30d6e17dde7a710459a.avif?t=1765179526\" width=540 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crazy Roads</strong> is a fast-paced, endless driving game set on stunning, procedurally generated forest roads. The goal is simple: <strong>drive fast, earn more points</strong>, creating a thrilling balance between speed and control as you navigate challenging curves to maximize your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Points unlock a growing collection of unique cars, from hatchbacks to vintage sports cars, each with its own handling. Randomly generated tasks appear during gameplay, offering extra challenges and rewards. Completing them earns experience points to level up your car's mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>World Mode</strong>, the adventure expands as you travel the exact distance between any two countries. Once you've driven the <strong>real-world</strong> distance, the destination country is marked as &quot;traveled,&quot; with the ultimate goal being to visit every country in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining instant arcade fun with deep progression, <strong>Crazy Roads</strong> makes every drive an exciting adventure with long-term goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/1479e3130cd8d38b3d3291b86a32c831.avif?t=1765179526\" width=540 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless gameplay with dynamically generated roads</strong>: A new, unique road is created with every playthrough.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/166c515d4dcd1a05884a6a5397f8e015.poster.avif?t=1765179526\" width=800 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/166c515d4dcd1a05884a6a5397f8e015.webm?t=1765179526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed-based scoring</strong>: The faster you drive, the more points you earn, creating a thrilling risk-vs-reward dynamic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/9680a22d55464c4f76114dec4bff0721.poster.avif?t=1765179526\" width=800 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/9680a22d55464c4f76114dec4bff0721.webm?t=1765179526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car collection</strong>: Unlock a growing garage of vehicles using the points you earn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/cfed14d968295bd62a279a9b899ba2c4.avif?t=1765179526\" width=1280 height=398 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random tasks &amp; challenges</strong>: Complete objectives during gameplay for bonus experience points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car mastery system</strong>: Each car has its own progression level, allowing you to improve its performance and unlock new features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization rewards</strong>: Unlock new visual options and upgrades as you master each car.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Mode</strong>: A unique challenge where you travel the real-life distance between countries, with the goal of visiting every country in the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic weather &amp; seasonal changes:</strong> Experience rain, snow, storms, and shifting seasons that affect visibility, road conditions, and the atmosphere of each drive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/fdbe4feb5ed42d1f8920450f7c37750a.avif?t=1765179526\" width=800 height=550 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive fast, complete challenges, master your favourite cars, and customize them to your style in this addictive arcade racing experience!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4028070?t=1765179526","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/a99159aa2ac7cb60487a18d09800829230e4db09/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765179526","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/f38af0b77947a46a0a12b76a074e7263f8a86943/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765179526","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/f38af0b77947a46a0a12b76a074e7263f8a86943/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765179526","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4149360,"descr