e between countries, with the goal of visiting every country in the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic weather &amp; seasonal changes:</strong> Experience rain, snow, storms, and shifting seasons that affect visibility, road conditions, and the atmosphere of each drive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/extras/fdbe4feb5ed42d1f8920450f7c37750a.avif?t=1765179526\" width=800 height=550 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive fast, complete challenges, master your favourite cars, and customize them to your style in this addictive arcade racing experience!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["ShuffleGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028070/7d89a45f6aeff2d349774de3a48aabd53719e353/header.jpg?t=1765179526","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4028070/2132984475/8380efbad7891c32ada2affac2e64c1f77fd7a6a/1758518521/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758523250","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4028070/2132984475/8380efbad7891c32ada2affac2e64c1f77fd7a6a/1758518521/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758523250","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4028070/2132984475/8380efbad7891c32ada2affac2e64c1f77fd7a6a/1758518521/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758523250","id":257196135,"name":"Crazy Roads - Alpha Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257196135/198071c143c24c14520ef617c5c2c9aa5f12ed1f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758523250"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/40